nt-family:나눔명조;font-size:12.0pt;">편입 </span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-family:나눔명조;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">: </span><span style="font-family:나눔명조;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-size:12.0pt;">국내</span><span style="font-family:나눔명조;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;mso-hansi-font-family:나눔명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">․</span><span style="font-family:나눔명조;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-size:12.0pt;">외 대학원에서 </span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-family:나눔명조;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">1</span><span style="font-family:나눔명조;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-size:12.0pt;">학기 이상을 이수한 자</span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-family:나눔명조;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">(2026</span><span style="font-family:나눔명조;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-size:12.0pt;">년 </span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-family:나눔명조;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">8</span><span style="font-family:나눔명조;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-size:12.0pt;">월 예정자 포함</span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-family:나눔명조;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">)</span></p><p class="0" style="line-height: 1.5; margin-left: 30pt; margin-right: 102.7pt; text-indent: -30pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-size:12.0pt;">  </span><span style="font-family:나눔명조;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;mso-hansi-font-family:나눔명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">※ </span><span style="font-family:나눔명조;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-size:12.0pt;">이전 학위과정 전공 분야와 다른 세부 전공으로 입학할 수 있으며</span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-family:나눔명조;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">, </span><span style="font-family:나눔명조;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-size:12.0pt;">재학 중 소정의 선수과목을 이수하여야 함</span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-family:나눔명조;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">.</span></p><p class="0" style="line-height: 1.5; font-size: 12pt;">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p><p class="0" style="line-height: 1.5;"><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조 ExtraBold;font-family:나눔명조 ExtraBold;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조 ExtraBold;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:13.0pt;">3. </span><span style="font-family:나눔명조 ExtraBold;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조 ExtraBold;font-weight:bold;font-size:13.0pt;">전형일정</span></p><p class="0" style="line-height: 1.5;"><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-size:12.0pt;">   </span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-family:나눔명조;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;color:#ff0000;">1) </span><span style="font-family:나눔명조;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-size:12.0pt;color:#ff0000;">원서교부 </span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-family:나눔명조;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;color:#ff0000;">: 2026. 5. 11(</span><span style="font-family:나눔명조;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-size:12.0pt;color:#ff0000;">월</span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-family:나눔명조;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;colo