pt;font-size:12.0pt;">)</span></p><p class="0" style="line-height: 1.5;"><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-size:12.0pt;">   </span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-family:나눔명조;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">2) </span><span style="font-family:나눔명조;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-size:12.0pt;">일시 </span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-family:나눔명조;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">: 2026. 6. 25(</span><span style="font-family:나눔명조;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-size:12.0pt;">목</span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-family:나눔명조;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">) 14:00</span></p><p class="0" style="line-height: 1.5;"><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-size:12.0pt;">   </span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-family:나눔명조;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">3) </span><span style="font-family:나눔명조;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-size:12.0pt;">준비물 </span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-family:나눔명조;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">: </span><span style="font-family:나눔명조;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-size:12.0pt;">가사</span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-family:나눔명조;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">, </span><span style="font-family:나눔명조;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-size:12.0pt;">장삼</span></p><p class="0" style="line-height: 1.5; font-weight: bold; font-size: 13pt;">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p><p