nt-family:나눔명조;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-size:12.0pt;">모든 증명서의 발급 시기는 최근 </span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-family:나눔명조;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">3</span><span style="font-family:나눔명조;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-size:12.0pt;">개월 이내로 함</span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-family:나눔명조;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">.</span></p><p class="0" style="line-height: 1.5; margin-left: 19.9pt; text-indent: -19.9pt;"><span style="font-family:나눔명조;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;mso-hansi-font-family:나눔명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">※ </span><span style="font-family:나눔명조;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-size:12.0pt;">졸업</span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-family:나눔명조;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">·</span><span style="font-family:나눔명조;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-size:12.0pt;">학위수여 예정 증명서 제출자는 입학일까지 졸업</span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-family:나눔명조;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">·</span><span style="font-family:나눔명조;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-size:12.0pt;">학위 수여 증명서를 제출해야 함</span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-family:나눔명조;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">.</span></p><p class="0" style="line-height: 1.5; margin-left: 19.9pt; text-indent: -19.9pt;"><span style="font-family:나눔명조;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;mso-hansi-font-family:나눔명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">※ </span><span style="font-family:나눔명조;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-size:12.0pt;">해외 대학 수학자는 학력 인정에 필요한 서류의 원본과 번역</span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-family:나눔명조;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">·</span><span style="font-family:나눔명조;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-size:12.0pt;">공증본을 추가 제출해야 함</span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-family:나눔명조;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">.</span></p><p class="0" style="line-height: 1.5; margin-left: 19.9pt; margin-right: 42.7pt; text-indent: -19.9pt;"><span style="font-family:나눔명조;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;mso-hansi-font-family:나눔명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">※ </span><span style="font-family:나눔명조;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-size:12.0pt;">외국인</span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-family:나눔명조;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">·</span><span style="font-family:나눔명조;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-size:12.0pt;">해외 대학 수학자는 학력 조회 등에 필요한 출신대학 담당자의 연락처와 추가 서류를 합격시 제출해야 함</span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-family:나눔명조;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">. </span></p><p class="0" style="line-height: 1.5; margin-left: 19.9pt; text-indent: -19.9pt; font-size: 12pt;">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p><p class="0" style="line-height: 1.5;"><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조 ExtraBold;font-family:나눔명조 ExtraBold;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조 ExtraBold;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:13.0pt;">6. </span><span style="font-family:나눔명조 ExtraBold;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조 ExtraBold;font-weight:bold;font-size:13.0pt;">입학원서대 및 전형료</span></p><p class="0" style="line-height: 1.5;"><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-size:12.0pt;">  </span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-family:나눔명조;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">1) </span><span style="font-family:나눔명조;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-size:12.0pt;">원서대 </span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-family:나눔명조;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">: </span><span style="font-family:나눔명조;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-size:12.0pt;">무료 </span></p><p class="0" style="line-height: 1.5;"><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-size:12.0pt;">  </span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-family:나눔명조;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">2) </span><span style="font-family:나눔명조;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-size:12.0pt;">전형료 </span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-family:나눔명조;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">: </span><span style="font-family:나눔명조;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-size:12.0pt;">석사과정 </span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-family:나눔명조;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">60,000</span><span style="font-family:나눔명조;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-size:12.0pt;">원  </span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-family:나눔명조;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">/ </span><span style="font-family:나눔명조;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-size:12.0pt;">박사과정 </span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-family:나눔명조;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">80,000</span><span style="font-family:나눔명조;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-size:12.0pt;">원</span></p><p class="0" style="line-height: 1.5; font-size: 12pt;">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p><p class="0" style="line-height: 1.5;"><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조 ExtraBold;font-family:나눔명조 ExtraBold;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조 ExtraBold;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:13.0pt;">7. </span><span style="font-family:나눔명조 ExtraBold;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조 ExtraBold;font-weight:bold;font-size:13.0pt;">사정원칙 </span></p><p class="0" style="line-height: 1.5;"><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-size:12.0pt;">  </span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-family:나눔명조;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">1) </span><span style="font-family:나눔명조;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-size:12.0pt;">지원자격 미비자</span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-family:나눔명조;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">, </span><span style="font-family:나눔명조;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-size:12.0pt;">제출서류에 허위나 하자가 있는 자는 불합격 처리함</span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-family:나눔명조;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">.</span></p><p class="0" style="line-height: 1.5;"><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-size:12.0pt;">  </span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-family:나눔명조;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">2) </span><span style="font-family:나눔명조;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-size:12.0pt;">정당한 사유 없이 면접 미응시자는 불합격 처리함</span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-family:나눔명조;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">.</span></p><p class="0" style="line-height: 1.5;"><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-size:12.0pt;">  </span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-family:나눔명조;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">3) </span><span style="font-family:나눔명조;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-size:12.0pt;">예비순위를 받은 지원자에게는 등록마감 후 개별연락 하여 합격여부를 통지함</span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-family:나눔명조;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">. </span></p><p class="0" style="line-height: 1.5; margin-left: 30.5pt; margin-right: 47.2pt; text-indent: -30.5pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-size:12.0pt;">  </span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-family:나눔명조;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">4) </span><span style="font-family:나눔명조;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-size:12.0pt;">편입학자의 이수학점 및 이수학기 인정은 전공교수회의의 심의에 따라 최소 수료학점의 </span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-family:나눔명조;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">1/2</span><span style="font-family:나눔명조;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-size:12.0pt;">까지 인정 가능함</span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-family:나눔명조;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">.</span></p><p class="0" style="line-height: 1.5;"><span style="font-family:나눔명조;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;mso-hansi-font-family:나눔명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">※ </span><span style="font-family:나눔명조;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-size:12.0pt;">상기 사정원칙에 기재하지 않은 기타 사항은 입시관리위원회에서 결정함</span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-family:나눔명조;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">. </span></p><p class="0" style="line-height: 1.5; font-size: 12pt;">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p><p class="0" style="line-height: 1.5;"><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조 ExtraBold;font-family:나눔명조 ExtraBold;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조 ExtraBold;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:13.0pt;">8. </span><span style="font-family:나눔명조 ExtraBold;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조 ExtraBold;font-weight:bold;font-size:13.0pt;">지원자 유의사항 </span></p><p class="0" style="line-height: 1.5;"><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-size:12.0pt;">  </span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-family:나눔명조;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">1) </span><span style="font-family:나눔명조;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;letter-spacing:-0.2pt;font-size:12.0pt;">제출된 서류 및 전형료는 반환하지 않으며</span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-family:나눔명조;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.2pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">, </span><span style="font-family:나눔명조;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;letter-spacing:-0.2pt;font-size:12.0pt;">접수된 서류의 기재사항은 변경할 수 없음</span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-family:나눔명조;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.2pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">. </span></p><p class="0" style="line-height: 1.5;"><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-size:12.0pt;">  </span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-family:나눔명조;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">2) </span><span style="font-family:나눔명조;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-size:12.0pt;">모집결과는 합격자에 한하여 개별 통지</span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-family:나눔명조;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">(SMS) </span><span style="font-family:나눔명조;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-size:12.0pt;">및 홈페이지 게재</span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-family:나눔명조;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">(www.sangha.ac.kr)</span></p><p class="0" style="line-height: 1.5;"><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;font-size:12.0pt;"> </span></p><p class="0" style="line-height: 1.5;"><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조 ExtraBold;font-family:나눔명조 ExtraBold;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조 ExtraBold;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:13.0pt;">9. </span><span style="font-family:나눔명조 ExtraBold;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조 ExtraBold;font-weight:bold;font-size:13.0pt;">우편물 주소 </span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조 ExtraBold;font-family:나눔명조 ExtraBold;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조 ExtraBold;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:13.0pt;">: </span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-family:나눔명조;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">10118 </span><span style="font-family:나눔명조;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-size:12.0pt;">경기도 김포시 승가로 </span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-family:나눔명조;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">123 </span><span style="font-family:나눔명조;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-size:12.0pt;">중앙승가대학교 대학원 교학부</span></p><p class="0" style="line-height: 1.5; font-size: 12pt;">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p><p class="0" style="line-height: 1.5;"><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조 ExtraBold;font-family:나눔명조 ExtraBold;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조 ExtraBold;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:13.0pt;">10. </span><span style="font-family:나눔명조 ExtraBold;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조 ExtraBold;font-weight:bold;font-size:13.0pt;">전화 문의처 </span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조 ExtraBold;font-family:나눔명조 ExtraBold;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조 ExtraBold;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:13.0pt;">: </span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔명조;font-family:나눔명조;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">031)980-7862</span></p><p class="0" style="line-height: 1.5; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;font-size:12.0pt;">     </span></p><p class="0" style="line-height: 1.5; margin-left: 59.5pt; margin-right: 82.7pt; text-indent: -59.5pt;"><span style="font-family:나눔고딕 ExtraBold;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔고딕 ExtraBold;font-size:12.0pt;">특전 </span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔고딕 ExtraBold;font-family:나눔고딕 ExtraBold;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔고딕 ExtraBold;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">: 1) </span><span style="font-family:나눔고딕 ExtraBold;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔고딕 ExtraBold;font-size:12.0pt;">석사학위 취득 및 박사학위과정 수료시 승가고시법 시행령에 의거 각급 승가고시 응시 자격으로 인정됨</span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔고딕 ExtraBold;font-family:나눔고딕 ExtraBold;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔고딕 ExtraBold;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">.</span></p><p class="0" style="line-height: 1.5; margin-left: 60pt; text-indent: -60pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔고딕 ExtraBold;font-size:12.0pt;"></span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔고딕 ExtraBold;font-family:나눔고딕 ExtraBold;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔고딕 ExtraBold;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 2) </span><span style="font-family:나눔고딕 ExtraBold;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔고딕 ExtraBold;font-size:12.0pt;">조계종 승려는 건학이념구현 장학금으로 수업료의 </span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔고딕 ExtraBold;font-family:나눔고딕 ExtraBold;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔고딕 ExtraBold;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">1/2</span><span style="font-family:나눔고딕 ExtraBold;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔고딕 ExtraBold;font-size:12.0pt;">을 지급함</span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔고딕 ExtraBold;font-family:나눔고딕 ExtraBold;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔고딕 ExtraBold;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">.</span></p><p class="0" style="line-height: 1.5;"><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔고딕 ExtraBold;font-size:12.0pt;"></span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔고딕 ExtraBold;font-family:나눔고딕 ExtraBold;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔고딕 ExtraBold;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 3) </span><span style="font-family:나눔고딕 ExtraBold;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔고딕 ExtraBold;font-size:12.0pt;">각종 교내</span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔고딕 ExtraBold;font-family:나눔고딕 ExtraBold;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔고딕 ExtraBold;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">·</span><span style="font-family:나눔고딕 ExtraBold;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔고딕 ExtraBold;font-size:12.0pt;">외 장학금 지급</span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-fareast-font-family:나눔고딕 ExtraBold;font-family:나눔고딕 ExtraBold;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔고딕 ExtraBold;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;">.</span></p><div id="hwpEditorBoardContent" class="hwp_editor_board_content" data-hjsonver="1.0" data-jsonlen="62746"><!--[data-hwpjson]{
